674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AMaLmcldOEgQ7kNvwHgdrUJ&_nc_oc=AdoRr4VpC_1Y9gGt4ybP935pfEK2QkafZ9Q75id69eF5qQndgotLPotN3sASyhDTkrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJTvqPF-IXBVsM0gL2SZ3XWRybaFf4MEwkYGlMTgq-Bpg&oe=6AAFEE59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3nt3hwII18QQ7kNvwHnvZAx&_nc_oc=AdqqPLjQBNNmZ4GHJ4UmQp6smHkG6wkDZ21yP2cG7CH5aHrUuindmJbGqqYwG3cQSTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIvJZWWMc7lYpSndXM4tSjj0o2jPNOaf5R7VsQiaDl_IQ&oe=6AAFF716"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-MY-DRjH_UAQ7kNvwHklNXG&_nc_oc=Adp4HuBSZYzEb2ZF_Jfsjr5m2btKDt1eZcum48hKYMoLMxMV3UNwgxQkYejnBFtP1Fo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKl7hdANE1_SWK1Ct68qGtlwO78t7MsaDUhYa2xF-KUcw&oe=6AAFF331"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip